1":320,"1732":1591,"1733":1183,"1734":1614,"1735":709,"1736":563,"1737":705,"1738":1102,"1739":557,"1740":1278,"1741":1333,"1742":873,"1743":1482,"1744":872,"1745":874,"1746":562,"1747":1279,"1748":391,"1749":1334,"1750":392,"1751":1483,"1752":394},"orderedDocs":[[650,"**`<Text slot=\"label\">`** — any `Text` child with `slot=\"label\"` has its `id` linked to the button via `aria-labelledby`. This is the recommended way to provide a contextual label that is also visible to sighted users."],[651,"**`aria-label`** — pass `aria-label` on the `DropZone` component to override or supplement the label (e.g. `aria-label=\"Upload profile photo\"`). When no `Text slot=\"label\"` is present and no `aria-label` is set, the button falls back to the default \"DropZone\" label provided by React Aria."],[1446,"**`ButtonGroup`** - a cluster of related actions (a wrapping row with `role=\"group\"`). Overlay parents like `Modal` adopt it with end alignment and padding."],[1443,"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."],[1448,"**`CornerActions`** - an always-visible structural row for actions placed at a surface corner."],[430,"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[1445,"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1447,"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."],[1444,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[753,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[752,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[760,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[761,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[759,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1625,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1198,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[741,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[221,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[745,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[318,"**Adjustable gap**: `cellPadding` sets the gap between cells in px"],[1451,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1589,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1623,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1231,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1353,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[1004,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[1003,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[1232,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[236,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[738,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[792,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[232,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[231,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[743,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[234,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1703,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[380,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[816,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[270,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[265,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[267,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[266,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[814,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[269,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[424,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[423,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[800,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[315,"**Closed cells**: Set `value: null` to render a dashed-border empty rectangle for unavailable slots"],[740,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1588,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[1375,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1062,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1377,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[971,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[811,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[969,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1066,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1379,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1591,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1624,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1590,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[907,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[219,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[324,"**Custom tooltips**: Replace the built-in tooltip with any React node via `renderTooltip`, for example a period-over-period comparison; it is wrapped in the shared chart tooltip container"],[218,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[274,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[799,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[216,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[314,"**Discrete color buckets**: Define threshold ranges with explicit colors — no continuous gradient"],[801,"**DOM Output:**"],[746,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1619,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[817,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[805,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[320,"**Fills its container**: Give the chart (or its parent) a height and the rows stretch to fill it, up to `maxCellHeight`; a smaller height makes it scroll"],[790,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[333,"**Fixed height** (the `height` prop, or a parent with a height): `height` is the total, including the axis and legend."],[739,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1382,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[793,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[233,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[245,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[248,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[237,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[316,"**Hover cross-highlight**: Hovering or focusing a cell bolds the matching row and column axis labels"],[906,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[897,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[768,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[808,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[217,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[429,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[428,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[317,"**Keyboard accessible**: Focusing a cell shows its tooltip, the same as hovering"],[240,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[970,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1702,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[273,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[804,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[235,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[821,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[239,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1592,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry