hen color prop is set"],[774,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[770,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[772,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[773,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[775,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1484,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`, `data-required`, `data-size`"],[1414,"`default`, `full`, and `none` rounding"],[602,"`drawerProps` customizes the drawer, which defaults to `85dvh`; `popoverProps` customizes the popover."],[622,"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."],[692,"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."],[1648,"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."],[679,"`FileTrigger` adds no visuals or ARIA of its own — accessibility comes from the pressable child you provide. Use a component with an accessible name (e.g. an Antares `Button` with clear label text) so assistive technology announces the action. The underlying `<input>` is visually hidden but remains operable by keyboard through the child's press behavior."],[925,"`Flex` is a one-dimensional layout component for arranging children in rows or columns with alignment and spacing control. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[779,"`focusable=\"false\"`: Prevents keyboard focus"],[947,"`Grid` is a two-dimensional CSS Grid layout component for complex grid-based layouts. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[565,"`Icon slot=\"indicator\"` is decorative and receives `aria-hidden=\"true\"` automatically."],[849,"`InlineDrawerPanel` is the collapsible content for the a